    {
      "id": "claim_544317d3071649f59e97635c41deb423",
      "statement": "The automated suite exercises the real production pipeline (create_app → JobStore → WorkerLoop → run_pipeline → subprocess) and fakes only the edges: the OpenWiki CLI via OPENWIKI_BIN and the provider HTTP client. No test module patches pipeline, wiki_runner, packer or publisher, so regressions in the glue between them fail the suite.",
