      "statement": "`wait_for_status` polls `GET /wikis/{wiki_id}` every 0.1 s until the terminal set `{done, failed, cancelled}` (30 s default) and `wait_for_state` polls every 0.05 s until a specific non-terminal status (15 s default); both assert every response is 200, and the second is what lets tests observe `generating` before cancelling or before queueing a second wiki.",
