      "statement": "The suite runs with pytest configured in `pyproject.toml` (`testpaths = [\"tests\"]`, `addopts = \"-q\"`) and the `test` extra (`pytest>=8.0`); the documented commands are `uv venv --python 3.12`, `uv pip install -e \".[test]\"` and `uv run pytest`, and no CI workflow runs pytest: the only workflow under `.github/workflows/` is the scheduled OpenWiki wiki refresh, which installs the real CLI (`npm install --global openwiki@0.6.0`) and calls `openwiki code --update --print` instead.",
