    {
      "id": "claim_0dd9802d6df244d096e777acc923ec4e",
      "statement": "The harness is a trust boundary rather than a correctness proof: the fake CLI never calls a model, git operations use only local repositories and `file://`-style URIs, `JobStore` is exercised on one filesystem (so the documented Postgres multi-host path is uncovered), and `/docs` is only asserted as an advertised URL, leaving a real provider, the real OpenWiki CLI beyond the pinned contract, real forges and multi-host behaviour as manual verification items.",
